{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"screen\":\"他又怕还要等很久，才能再遇上那样亲近的人，心里渐渐静了下来（第8秒出现）；像被一股气流推着往前跑，兴奋得几乎来不及喘气（第12秒出现）\",\"source\":\"约第269小节，钢琴展开快速、炫目的八度进行，明亮、迅疾的音型向前冲出，把积累的能量一下子释放出来。如果说前一刻像在宏大地放声歌唱，那么这一刻更像身体被一股气流推着往前跑，兴奋得几乎来不及喘息。但这股冲势没有一直持续。约第281–285小节，音乐收敛下来，颤动般的装饰音重新带来一点不安。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"屏幕把冲势减弱、心里渐静的内容放在快速八度冲出之前；定稿中先是第269小节的快速冲势，之后第281–285小节才收敛，先后顺序颠倒。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e28ef933-9a4b-42d7-9d47-50c53b7ce247", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T010415237991Z", "elapsed_seconds": 298.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T01:09:13.975409+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e5d0a4541b1486470ee3c4bf4579e6591f20df816a9bbc0aacdcb8d714330333", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025